{
  "tema": 7847,
  "slug": "ver-oir-infinitivo",
  "titulo": "Ver, oír, escuchar + infinitive or gerund",
  "subtitulo": "La vi llegar. Lo oí cantando.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Ver / oír / escuchar + infinitive = see / hear someone do something (the whole action): Vi llegar a Marta. + gerund = see / hear someone doing it (in progress): La vi corriendo. The person is a direct object (lo, la), in front of the conjugated verb.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "After **ver, oír, escuchar**, the action you perceive can be an **infinitive** or a **gerund**:"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "+ infinitive",
              "texto": "The whole action, complete: **vi llegar a Marta** (_I saw Marta arrive_)."
            },
            {
              "forma": "+ gerund",
              "texto": "The action in progress: **vi a Marta llegando** (_I saw Marta arriving_)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Word order: short sentence, **verb + infinitive + a + person** (**vi llegar a Marta**). With more information, **verb + a + person + infinitive + extra** (**vi a Marta llegar muy asustada**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The person is a **direct object**: **la vi llegar**, **lo oí cantar**. The pronoun goes before the conjugated verb."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: infinitive = the whole clip; gerund = you walked in mid-scene."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Vi llegar== a Marta.",
              "en": "I saw Marta arrive."
            },
            {
              "es": "Vi a Marta ==llegar== muy asustada a la casa.",
              "en": "I saw Marta get home very scared."
            },
            {
              "es": "==La vi llegar==.",
              "en": "I saw her arrive."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Lo oí cantar== en la regadera.",
              "en": "I heard him sing in the shower."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Escuché a== los vecinos ==discutir== anoche.",
              "en": "I heard the neighbors argue last night."
            },
            {
              "es": "==La vi corriendo== en el malecón.",
              "en": "I saw her running on the boardwalk."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Los oímos llegando==.",
              "en": "We heard them arriving."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
